# Written by make_report.sh: what it writes again and git does not keep. Every DOT (its SVG is kept); each
# command's .cmd, .exit and .time (INDEX.tsv holds all three); a model record or a run's JSON a replay
# writes again; and any file over 200 KB (an SVG over 250 KB).
*.dot
*.cmd
*.exit
*.time
*/*/record/*
!*/*/record/steps/
!*/*/record/answer.json
live/bob1/*
!live/bob1/program.ein
!live/bob1/steps/
!live/bob1/answer.json
render/*/render-program.out
steps/bob1/calls.jsonl
steps/bob1/run.json
ein/show-hyps-hand-zebra-step1.out
ein/show-hyps-model-zebra-step1.out
